CompileTimeError: d139_storing_a_parameter_in_self_needs_copy.jern:7:30, line 7 column 30
 7 |         change $self.items = $new
   |                              ^^^^
 fix:  `copy $new`
 why:  a function sees a parameter frozen for the call, and keeping it after returning needs `copy` (D139, standard 3.6)
